From: Jan Alexander Steffens (heftig) <jan.steffens@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jan 2020 18:10:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ZEN: INTERACTIVE: Base config item

Reviewed port for Valve SteamOS 6.18.45.
Upstream: zen-kernel/zen-kernel fb5c79d96cc87e4778ac0f2a53bc7c0c23078c54
Upstream SHA-256: f22c6983d496d9038fa0f4288ee6cbb5b46837fee5f644f4759e4c26dcdff262

Preserve the upstream Zen INTERACTIVE configuration semantics while rebasing
the Kconfig insertion point onto Valve's 6.18.45 source layout.
---

diff --git a/init/Kconfig b/init/Kconfig
--- a/init/Kconfig
+++ b/init/Kconfig
@@ -191,6 +191,12 @@ menu "General setup"
 
+config ZEN_INTERACTIVE
+	bool "Tune kernel for interactivity"
+	default y
+	help
+	  Tunes the kernel for responsiveness at the cost of throughput and power usage.
+
 config BROKEN
 	bool
 	help
